BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:City of Durham (Government)
DESCRIPTION:The City’s General Services Department is opening its mulch y
 ard to the public beginning April 18\, with operating hours from 8 a.m. to
  noon. The yard will offer wood chips produced by our Urban Forestry team 
 - a natural blend of hardwood and softwood chips ideal for landscaping and
  gardening projects. https://www.durhamnc.gov/calendar.aspx?EID=10645
